Package: obsidian
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libgtk-3-0, libnotify4, libnss3, libxss1, libxtst6, xdg-utils, libatspi2.0-0, libuuid1, libsecret-1-0
Recommends: libappindicator3-1
Section: editors
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://obsidian.md
Description: Obsidian - private and flexible note-taking app (arm64 repack)
 Obsidian is a Markdown note-taking and knowledge-base application built
 on Electron.
 .
 Upstream only publishes an amd64 .deb. This package repacks the official
 arm64 Linux tarball from the same release into a .deb with the same
 layout, scripts, desktop entry and icons as upstream's amd64 package.
